Package: okapi
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, sudo, adduser, tzdata
Maintainer: Christina Ngalula <christinangalula@2028.ulc-icam.com>
Description: OKAPI cautious SNMPv3 network remediation prototype
 OKAPI receives Zabbix events, applies validation and safety policies,
 records decisions in SQLite, and exposes an interactive administrator CLI.
